      "message": "This fallback seems too late and too implicit for ZDR deployments. It only retries after toolExecutor.execute(...) fails with an existing conversation ID, but conversation resolution/creation happens earlier in resolveConversation(). If ZDR rejects conversation creation or resolution, this path will still fail before reaching the retry logic.\n\nSince ZDR support is typically known from deployment or configuration, it would be preferable to provide an explicit configuration option to disable OpenAI conversations rather than relying on a failed request per Change Set.",
