      "writtenOn": "2026-06-23T08:07:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This changes ReviewAI DB access from a managed H2 TCP server to a direct embedded file connection with AUTO_SERVER\u003dFALSE. We have already hit concurrent access issues with direct H2 file connections. H2 embedded mode supports multiple connections only within the same JVM/classloader, while server/mixed mode is the safe path when another JVM, classloader, reload, or tool may access the same DB. Please keep the managed TCP server path, or provide a concurrency/plugin-reload test proving this embedded URL is safe in Gerrit’s runtime. This DB access change also looks unrelated to the OpenAI ZDR conversation fallback and should be split out if still needed.",
